@@ -0,0 +1,20 @@
+issueNumber: MDL-89346
+notes:
+  mod_assign:
+    - message: >-
+        The external function `mod_assign_get_submission_status` now returns
+        the feedback of each individual marker (multiple markers assignments)
+        in the new optional `markers` field of both the `feedback` and
+        `previousattempts` structures. Each marker entry contains the mark
+        record id (`markid`), the marker user id (`marker`, -1 if the grader
+        is hidden) and the feedback plugins information (`plugins`) for that
+        marker.
+      type: changed
+    - message: >-
+        New methods `get_marker_file_areas()` and `get_overall_file_areas()`
+        have been added to `assign_feedback_plugin`. Feedback plugins
+        supporting feedback per marker (multiple markers) should override
+        `get_marker_file_areas()` to return the file areas storing the files
+        of an individual marker's feedback (using the mark record id as item
+        id).
+      type: added
